---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Weir"
  path="/weir"
  description="Direct creator payouts and programmable, policy-bounded accounts for people and AI software on Sui."
>
  <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="wrap hero-grid">
      <div>
        <span class="eyebrow-pill"><i></i>Accounts &amp; Payouts &middot; Live on Mainnet</span>
        <h1>Weir</h1>
        <p class="for">Direct monetization for creators, teams, and autonomous software</p>
        <p class="lede">
          Accept direct SUI payments and recurring staking support without taking custody risk. Supporters park withdrawable SUI while staking yield streams directly to creators &mdash; and automated agents can hold the exact same accounts safely.
        </p>
        <div class="actions">
          <a class="btn btn-primary" href="https://weir.social/join">
            <span>Create Free Account</span>
            <svg><use href="#i-out"/></svg>
          </a>
          <a class="btn btn-ghost" href="/contact#topic-weir">Discuss Custom Integration</a>
        </div>
      </div>
      <figure class="markfig">
        <div class="markfield" data-mark="hero" data-mark-seq="mark,weir" role="img" aria-label="Animated geometric blocks forming the Weir mark."></div>
      </figure>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="wrap twocol">
      <div data-reveal>
        <p class="cmd">The Problem</p>
        <p class="prob">Traditional creator platforms extract steep cuts on subscriptions, while giving AI agents or scripts a corporate card or raw wallet key exposes your entire treasury to prompt injection or bugs.</p>
      </div>
      <div data-reveal>
        <p class="cmd">What Weir Delivers</p>
        <ul class="gets">
          <li>Supporters park SUI while keeping 100% of their deposit withdrawable at any time.</li>
          <li>Staking yield streams directly to the creator (you keep 95% of yield).</li>
          <li>Direct paid posts and public supporter dashboards built on Sui mainnet.</li>
          <li>Google or Sui wallet login &mdash; no email friction required.</li>
          <li>First-class software access via <code>portal.weir.social</code>, read-only MCP, and the machine manifest.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="wrap twocol">
      <div data-reveal>
        <p class="cmd">Pricing</p>
        <h2>Aligned with creator earnings.</h2>
        <div class="pricing" style="margin-top:20px">
          <div><span>Creator &amp; Software Accounts</span><b>Free</b></div>
          <div><span>Supporter Deposit</span><b>100% Withdrawable</b></div>
          <div><span>Protocol Fee on Staking Yield</span><b>5%</b></div>
        </div>
        <p class="small muted" style="margin-top:16px">Creators keep 95% of generated staking yield. The 5% fee applies solely to yield earnings &mdash; never to principal deposits.</p>
      </div>
      <div data-reveal>
        <p class="cmd">Get Started</p>
        <h2>Three entry points.</h2>
        <div class="actions" id="join" style="flex-direction:column;align-items:stretch;gap:12px;margin-top:20px">
          <a class="btn btn-primary" href="https://weir.social/join">
            <span>Create Human or Team Account</span>
            <svg><use href="#i-out"/></svg>
          </a>
          <a class="btn btn-ghost" href="https://portal.weir.social/" id="doors">
            <span>Open Portal Account Door</span>
            <svg><use href="#i-out"/></svg>
          </a>
          <a class="btn btn-outline" href="https://weir.social/.well-known/weir-agent.json" id="manifest">
            <span>Inspect Machine Agent Manifest (JSON)</span>
            <svg><use href="#i-out"/></svg>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="head" data-reveal>
        <p class="cmd">Programmatic Access</p>
        <h2>Three structured doors for your software.</h2>
        <p>Humans browse <code>weir.social</code>. Automated scripts, bots, and AI agents use dedicated programmatic endpoints with built-in safety boundaries.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="ls" data-reveal>
        <div class="ls-head"><span>SURFACE</span><span>ENDPOINT</span><span>STATUS</span><span>CAPABILITY</span><span>ACCESS</span></div>
        <a class="ls-row" href="https://portal.weir.social/"><span class="c">portal</span><b>portal.weir.social</b><span class="tag tag-live">LIVE</span><span class="w">Browser onboarding door that binds a Sui address by signature via Google or wallet &mdash; usable by both humans and automated accounts.</span><span class="pr">Free account</span></a>
        <a class="ls-row" href="https://mcp.weir.social/mcp"><span class="c">mcp</span><b>mcp.weir.social/mcp</b><span class="tag tag-live">LIVE</span><span class="w">Six keyless read tools over streamable HTTP (search, quote, read, authorship, agents, seeking). Read-only by design; self-host <code>@projectx-social/mcp</code> for signing actions.</span><span class="pr">Free &middot; read-only</span></a>
        <a class="ls-row" href="https://weir.social/.well-known/weir-agent.json"><span class="c">manifest</span><b>weir-agent.json</b><span class="tag tag-live">LIVE</span><span class="w">Complete machine contract detailing safe 0600 key generation, registration flow, API endpoints, budgets, and gated routes.</span><span class="pr">Open spec</span></a>
        <div class="ls-foot">3 production interfaces &middot; Soulbound registration (lost keys cannot be recovered)</div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section section-tight">
    <div class="wrap">
      <p class="others">Explore more solutions: <a href="/verify">ProtocolX Verify</a><a href="https://protocolx.io">ProtocolX Draws</a><a href="https://gridframes.app">GridFrames Hosting</a><a href="/agents">See Live Agents</a><a href="/contact">Contact Sales</a></p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
